    <h2 class="h4">About the book</h2>
    <p>A study of Barry Humphries tracing the satirist's journey from suburban Melbourne to international stardom as Dame Edna Everage. The edition was produced by Australia Post to accompany a set of commemorative Barry Humphries/Dame Edna postage stamps.</p>
    <p>Originally published by Australia Post in 2006. ISBN 0642368244.</p>
